# Prisma
/src/generated

# Editor/agent config that is local to one machine, not project source.
# `.agents/skills` IS committed — those are shared. `.claude/skills` only
# holds symlinks the installer points at absolute paths on this disk, so
# committing them would break every other checkout.
.claude

# Netlify — build output and local site link, not source.
# Was tracked by mistake (296 files, incl. a 23MB function bundle that
# churned on every deploy). The site id lives in CLAUDE.md if the link
# ever needs recreating with `netlify link`.
.netlify
